'''G1 Climax 2026 Day 10''' was the tenth show of the [[G1 Climax 2026]] tournament produced by [[New Okaiken Pro-Wrestling|NOPW]], held on September 23, 2026 at the Naruto Municipal Gymnasium in [[Naruto]]. The show featured all five [[G1 Climax 2026|Block B]] Round 5 matches.

The night is remembered for the end of the block's perfect era — [[KAZUKI (wrestler)|KAZUKI]] against [[Takagi Yuto]], the shooting star against the dragon — and for the champions' war: [[Jusuf Muntasir]] against [[Taumafa Vaiahi|Taumafa]], the IC champion against the Strong Openweight champion, the truth-teller against the family warrior.

